+"""Retired legacy real-code DGM demonstration.
+
+The former benchmark ran model-produced candidate code through an in-process
+hidden-test grader.  Giving its solver an isolated runner would not make that
+safe: the emitted code could still execute in the benchmark host while being
+scored.  It also created an operator private key in the same process that
+authored and evaluated the candidate, which invalidated the claimed approval
+boundary.
