+This entrypoint therefore fails closed.  It is intentionally not a deployment
+or sandbox claim.  A replacement must supply both (1) an isolated solver worker
+and (2) an isolated hidden-test grader, then use the external public-key and
+detached-signature transaction exposed by ``benchmarks/dgm_live.py``.
