+# A governed code candidate is deliberately narrower than a general Git patch:
+# it may change the *contents* of an allowlisted regular text file, but it may
+# not change its object type or permissions.  Git encodes symlinks as 120000 and
+# submodules as 160000; accepting either would let an otherwise allowlisted path
